/-!
# Three pair orbits in the native plane

The two hexad-orbit generators and a third native stabilizer element give
the three orbits on unordered pairs. A finite forest records literal transporters. At its roots,
the existing 77 hexads verify the three source incidence patterns.
Source: Aschbacher–Segev (1991), (5.3)(3), p.600.
-/
@[expose] public section
namespace Theory.GroupTheory.Recognition.JankoFour.SourceIncidence.NativePairs
open Sporadic.Mathieu SourceCycleBase
open scoped Pointwise

